PATCH http://localhost:3000/polls/41/vote HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1

{
	"type": "multiple_choice",
	"optionsVoted": [
		{
			"optionId": 130
		}
	]
}

### update a vote that doesn't exist (user 7 never voted on poll 42) -> 404 Not Found
PATCH http://localhost:3000/polls/42/vote HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 7

{
	"type": "multiple_choice",
	"optionsVoted": [ { "optionId": 131 } ]
}

### option belongs to a different poll (option 4 is on poll 2, not 42) -> 400 Bad Request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/polls/42/vote HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 3

{
	"type": "multiple_choice",
	"optionsVoted": [ { "optionId": 4 } ]
}

### update on a poll that is not "active" (poll 41 is currently "pending") -> 403 Forbidden
PATCH http://localhost:3000/polls/41/vote HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1

{
	"type": "multiple_choice",
	"optionsVoted": [ { "optionId": 130 } ]
}

### change the label on an existing slider vote -> 200, label reflects the new value
PATCH http://localhost:3000/polls/16/vote HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1

{
	"type": "slider",
	"optionsVoted": [ { "optionId": 54 } ],
	"label": "3"
}
